  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Steigung aus zwei Punkten berechnen</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 12px;'>Wenn zwei Punkte einer Geraden bekannt sind, l&auml;sst sich die Steigung direkt ausrechnen &ndash; ohne Graph.</p><div style='background:#1C1B1F;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:2;margin-bottom:12px;'><strong>Vorgehen:</strong><br>&#x2460;&nbsp;y-Differenz: &Delta;y = y&#x2082; &minus; y&#x2081;<br>&#x2461;&nbsp;x-Differenz: &Delta;x = x&#x2082; &minus; x&#x2081;<br>&#x2462;&nbsp;Steigung: m = &Delta;y : &Delta;x</div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1.5px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;'><strong>Beispiel:</strong>&nbsp;P&#x2081;(1|2) und P&#x2082;(3|6)<br><span style='font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;'>&Delta;y = 6 &minus; 2 = 4 &nbsp;|&nbsp; &Delta;x = 3 &minus; 1 = 2 &nbsp;|&nbsp; m = 4 : 2 = <strong>2</strong></span></div></div><div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgaben &ndash; Berechne m</div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:10px 0;'><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>a)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>P&#x2081;(0|1) und P&#x2082;(3|7)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>m&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='2' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>b)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>P&#x2081;(1|4) und P&#x2082;(3|2)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>m&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='-1' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>c)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>P&#x2081;(&minus;2|3) und P&#x2082;(2|5)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>m&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='0.5' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>d)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>P&#x2081;(0|&minus;1) und P&#x2082;(2|5)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>m&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='3' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(4)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(4)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-4'></span></div></div>",
  "sol_html": "<p style='font-size:14px;line-height:2.2;margin:0;font-family:monospace;'>a) &Delta;y = 7&minus;1 = 6, &Delta;x = 3&minus;0 = 3 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; m = 6:3 = <strong>2</strong><br>b) &Delta;y = 2&minus;4 = &minus;2, &Delta;x = 3&minus;1 = 2 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; m = &minus;2:2 = <strong>&minus;1</strong><br>c) &Delta;y = 5&minus;3 = 2, &Delta;x = 2&minus;(&minus;2) = 4 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; m = 2:4 = <strong>0,5</strong><br>d) &Delta;y = 5&minus;(&minus;1) = 6, &Delta;x = 2&minus;0 = 2 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; m = 6:2 = <strong>3</strong></p>"
}
